# one citation's PDF
psychclassics.yorku.ca
https://sanlab.psych.ucla.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/31/2016/03/Gross_JPSP_1998.pdf
https://web.stanford.edu/class/cs106m/meetings/03-pagerank/
